{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21207","headline":"和乐天别弟後月夜作 · 元稹","name":"和乐天别弟後月夜作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻君别爱弟，明天照夜寒。\n秋雁拂檐影，晓琴当砌弹。\n怅望天澹澹，因思路漫漫。\n吟爲别弟操，闻者爲辛酸。\n况我兄弟远，一身形影单。\n江波浩无极，但见时岁阑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}